<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile sells no antimony.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile sells no antimony.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center said it sold no antimony in the recent bid opening held June 24.</p>
<p>The next receipt of bids will be on July 22.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
</text>
